WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.401 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's always
so great to see you.

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.436 align:start size:94% position:6%
Congratulations on
the return of "Roseanne."

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:04.137 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-Thank you very much.

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:05.271 size:75% position:38%
-This must be beyond
your wildest dreams.

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:07.140
Even the fact that it came
together in the first place.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:11.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was a gift.
And I'm treating it as such.

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:13.313 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm very grateful
to be back there,

00:00:13.313 --> 00:00:18.718 align:start size:94% position:6%
as opposed to last time,
when I was "rehearsing" and...

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:21.821 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was remarkable
how it came together.

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:26.726 size:84% position:42%
I was on Sara Gilbert's
talk show, "The Talk."

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:27.494 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:28.595 line:92%
-In case there's any confusion.

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:31.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we did a little
"Roseanne"-ish sketch

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:31.931 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
at the top of it.

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:35.101 align:start size:94% position:6%
And during the show, she asked
me if I would be interested

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:36.970 align:start size:94% position:6%
in a reunion show
or something like that.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:39.873
A clip show. I don't know.
I said, yeah, in a heartbeat.

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:43.510 size:88% position:44%
And she called Roseanne,
said I was interested.

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:45.111 align:start size:94% position:6%
And three weeks later,
we had a deal with

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:46.746 align:start size:94% position:6%
the American
Broadcasting Company...

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:50.116 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's crazy.
-...also known as ABC.

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:50.950 line:92%
-You've always been a formal --

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:53.386
You always speak about networks
very formally.

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:54.888 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-The DuMont Network.

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:55.755 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughs ]

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:59.659
It's funny. Obviously you and
Roseanne have this chemistry.

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:00.760 line:92%
It's incredibly well-honed.

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:02.629 size:75% position:38%
I remember this year
at the Golden Globes

00:01:02.629 --> 00:01:04.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
you guys came out
and presented together.

00:01:04.264 --> 00:01:06.332 size:75% position:38%
And I was rehearsing
earlier in the day.

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:07.400 line:92%
And for people who don't know,

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.202 align:start size:94% position:6%
they just have extras
do the lines.

00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:13.139 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, I was watching, and it was
like a three-line exchange

00:01:13.139 --> 00:01:14.808 line:92%
between you and Roseanne.

00:01:14.808 --> 00:01:15.809 line:92%
But I watched two extras do it,

00:01:15.809 --> 00:01:17.444 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I was like,
"This isn't funny at all."

00:01:17.444 --> 00:01:18.378 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then you and Roseanne
came out

00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:20.380 align:start size:94% position:6%
and said the exact same thing,
and it just crushed.

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:24.284
-Well, they gave me a punch line
that didn't work.

00:01:24.284 --> 00:01:25.819 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-[ Laughs ] Oh, yeah?

00:01:25.819 --> 00:01:27.954 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And she saved my bacon.
-Oh, well, that's --

00:01:27.954 --> 00:01:32.192 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think that when you have
a partner in comedy like that,

00:01:32.192 --> 00:01:34.094 align:start size:94% position:6%
there's a lot of bacon saving.
-Oh, thank you.

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:36.129 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And you brought back
the whole cast.

00:01:36.129 --> 00:01:37.363 align:start size:94% position:6%
You even brought back
both Beckys.

00:01:37.363 --> 00:01:39.566
Was that a fun thing to have to
figure out the math of that?

00:01:39.566 --> 00:01:43.870
-Yeah, it was amazing. Yeah,
I couldn't recognize them apart.

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:46.272 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Which one is which?

00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:47.373 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Yeah, they fit her in.

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:52.545
She may even be coming back,
I don't know, doing something.

00:01:52.545 --> 00:01:54.180 size:88% position:44% line:92%
But it's just so bizarre

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:56.883 size:78% position:39%
to walk onto that set
for the first time.

00:01:56.883 --> 00:01:59.419 align:start size:94% position:6%
Everything is reproduced
exactly.

00:01:59.419 --> 00:02:01.454 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And I got chills.

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:05.024 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's not déjàà vu,
but it's something spookier.

00:02:05.024 --> 00:02:06.960 size:81% position:41%
I think Laurie Metcalf
calls it a wormhole.

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:09.996 align:start size:94% position:6%
-A wormhole. That makes sense.
So, you said reproduced.

00:02:09.996 --> 00:02:12.132 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's not the original set?
-No.

00:02:12.132 --> 00:02:16.169
They had to get stuff off of
eBay, I believe, that was ours.

00:02:16.169 --> 00:02:17.337 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, really?

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:18.638 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:18.638 --> 00:02:20.206 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The rumor
that I've been spreading

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:23.843 align:start size:94% position:6%
is that the Smithsonian
Institution owns the couch

00:02:23.843 --> 00:02:27.614 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they wouldn't
rent it back to us cheaply.

00:02:27.614 --> 00:02:29.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.
-But that's not true.

00:02:29.849 --> 00:02:32.352 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's a good rumor.
-Print the legend.

00:02:32.352 --> 00:02:34.287 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, absolutely.
Print the legend.

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:35.622 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Cheap bastards.

00:02:35.622 --> 00:02:36.890 align:start size:94% position:6%
I want to tell you
about the government!

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:40.059 align:start size:94% position:6%
Let me tell you about the
government! Aw, they're bad!

00:02:40.059 --> 00:02:42.996
-Well, the show, of course, is
a lot now about the government,

00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:46.499
not as much as I feel like
it's maybe getting ink for.

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:48.401 line:92%
Roseanne is a Trump supporter.

00:02:48.401 --> 00:02:53.373 size:81% position:41%
Laurie is a Hillary --
a left-wing supporter.

00:02:53.373 --> 00:02:54.807 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you know
going into the season

00:02:54.807 --> 00:02:56.609 align:start size:94% position:6%
what the stories
were going to be about?

00:02:56.609 --> 00:02:58.444 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I didn't care.
-Yeah, that --

00:02:58.444 --> 00:03:00.847 size:81% position:41%
-Which is pretty much
the way I went through

00:03:00.847 --> 00:03:02.615 line:92%
the last nine years of the show.

00:03:02.615 --> 00:03:03.616 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well.
-I don't care!

00:03:03.616 --> 00:03:05.251 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The other thing
that I think that helps

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:06.319 align:start size:94% position:6%
is Dan doesn't seem to care.
-No.

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:08.755 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's basically -- he's along
for the ride, as well.

00:03:08.755 --> 00:03:12.559 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He's out in the garage
drinking quite a bit of beer.

00:03:12.559 --> 00:03:13.493 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:03:13.493 --> 00:03:15.395 align:start size:94% position:6%
But he looks very svelte.
-Thank you.

00:03:15.395 --> 00:03:18.464 align:start size:94% position:6%
-New Dan looks very svelte.
You've done him a great favor.

00:03:18.464 --> 00:03:21.601 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Light beer.
-Yeah.

